📜 RapheyliX AI Usage Notice
RapheyliX AI is an intelligent assistant designed to support productivity, learning, and general assistance.

🧠 Nature of the System
RapheyliX AI generates responses using artificial intelligence.
While it is designed to be helpful and accurate, outputs may sometimes be incomplete or incorrect.
Users are encouraged to review and use their own judgement when applying any information provided.

💙 Responsibility
RapheyliX AI is a tool for assistance.
Users are responsible for how they choose to use its outputs in real-world situations.

🔐 Privacy & Design
RapheyliX AI is built with a privacy-first mindset and aims to respect user data and local processing principles where applicable.

⚖️ Limitation of Liability
The developer is not responsible for decisions made based on AI-generated content or for misuse of the system.

🌍 Respectful Use
Users agree to use RapheyliX AI responsibly and ethically.
